<title>UK: TABLE - B.A.T H1 profits slip 5 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE - B.A.T H1 profits slip 5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 23.4		  vs   25.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  10.0		  vs   10.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     1,247		  vs  1,311</p>
<p> Turnover (constant)   12,339		  vs 11,863</p>
<p> Turnover (current)    11,608		  vs 11,863</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1,237 and 1,301 million stg. Turnover given at both constant and current rates of exchange.</p>
<p>Full company name - B.A.T Industries Plc</p>
